  "limitations": [
    "Single development pair with a frozen draft reference requiring independent review; no general or causal improvement claim.",
    "A/B/C scores measure the same frozen claim-field projection contract; question placement, relevance and complete lists are not certified.",
    "Certificates and independent replay concern approved claims relative to extracted facts, not whole-answer accuracy or forensic truth.",
    "Missing or unavailable projections are unmeasured, never fabricated unknown answers; original failures remain retained.",
    "Atomic counts depend on list size and answer shape. Extra assertions and unequal values are contract mismatches, not forensic false positives.",
    "B filters whole exact A candidates, preserves pre-filter conflict omissions, and makes no posthoc binding or value repair.",
    "Wall caps do not establish equal token budgets; actual model revision, token usage, reasoning effort and cost remain unobserved.",
    "Procedural isolation and bridge logs do not establish complete platform-tool compliance; reused extracted facts do not measure extraction quality or end-to-end speed."
